        {
          "id": 666607742,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Yes this looks good.\n\nAlong the way of implementing this function I realized that s0kh_id holds the supplicant's MAC address which is fixed size. So no need for a length parameter for that. Apparently forgot to remove the documentation when I removed the parameter.\n\nNoticed a few more issues with the documentation for this function, but maybe you'd like to handle that in separate commit(s).\n\nLength is misspelled for r0kh_id_len \"Lenth of r0kh_id in bytes.\"\npmk_r0_len description is missing",
          "author": {
            "id": 361322,
